44	 *
45	 * Without (3), elements gated by mount-time assigns (#audio-player,
46	 * #speed-badge, etc.) can race the test's first `page.$()` and the
47	 * test fails with a misleading "selector not found" error. Tests that
48	 * need a specific element (e.g. #audio-player when audio_state is :ready)
